{"Intent":"Count words across documents in parallel to speed up indexing.","Target":"854ead79da1296e77c20f654f44ff34cb2d31603","Head":"29c1af2787212a95114ad9274ec702b070ce4c42","Diff":"diff --git a/text/count.go b/text/count.go
